error[V2310]: `x bad` is not an HTTP header name, so no request can send it
 --> services/users/users.api.yaml:8:7
  |
8 |       "x bad": "1"
  |       ^^^^^^^ not a header name
  = help: a header name has letters, digits and !#$%&'*+-.^_`|~ only, such as `X-Request-Id`

